{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 108,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.460205078125,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "panel noted that the evidence on both the intervention and on the comparator regimen was obtained",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.966650009155273,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.5897827148438,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "from programmatic data from South Africa such that, overall, the population and health care context",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.997300148010254,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.5699462890625,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "were comparable. However, the panel stressed that important differences exist between the two",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.4323120117188,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "cohorts or datasets that were compared, making it difficult to draw conclusions with full confidence.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        128.69459533691406,
        527.1625366210938,
        143.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "The panel judged that there was probably no important uncertainty or variability in how much",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        141.8946075439453,
        527.4430541992188,
        156.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "people value the main outcomes. The panel used available data on cost of component medicines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.09474182128906,
        527.4243774414062,
        169.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "combined with professional judgement to estimate the cost of the 9-month regimen with linezolid",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.29469299316406,
        527.5576171875,
        182.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "compared with the 9-month regimen with ethionamide among patients with MDR/RR-TB, susceptible",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.978829383850098,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.4947052001953,
        527.4312133789062,
        195.9376983642578
      ],
      "text": "to fluoroquinolones. The panel suggested that the cost would be expected to be very similar; that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.69471740722656,
        527.4388427734375,
        209.13771057128906
      ],
      "text": "is, for there to be negligible costs or savings. The panel also noted that no data were available on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.8946075439453,
        527.4400024414062,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "the cost of managing potential long-term consequences of neurotoxicity that can be caused by the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.09474182128906,
        527.4510498046875,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "use of linezolid, and that the risk is greater if linezolid is used for longer periods. The panel has also",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.29469299316406,
        527.4366455078125,
        248.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "noted that health care and patient costs are likely to be similar for regimens when used in a similar",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        247.4947052001953,
        275.2076110839844,
        261.9377136230469
      ],
      "text": "group of patients and for the same duration.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.1986083984375,
        527.44091796875,
        283.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "The GDG attempted to discuss cost–effectiveness of the two regimens; however, no evidence was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        282.39862060546875,
        527.4288940429688,
        296.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "available, the two regimens are identical in duration and they only differ in one component drug,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        295.5986328125,
        527.446533203125,
        310.0416564941406
      ],
      "text": "which would not change the overall cost of the regimen in any significant way. The similarity of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        308.798583984375,
        527.4288330078125,
        323.2416076660156
      ],
      "text": "two regimens also prevented a substantial discussion on the equity. The panel considered patients",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        321.99859619140625,
        527.442138671875,
        336.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "and health care providers as key stakeholders. The panel considered the following aspects as critical",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.1986083984375,
        527.4244384765625,
        349.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "with regard to acceptability: regimen duration, drug-safety monitoring needs (relating both to the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        348.39862060546875,
        527.41796875,
        362.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "necessary travel, loss of income and general disruption of the life of patients, and to workload for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        361.5986022949219,
        527.438720703125,
        376.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "the health care system) and DST needs. The panel judged that there were probably no differences in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        374.7986145019531,
        527.5729370117188,
        389.24163818359375
      ],
      "text": "acceptability between the 9-month regimen with linezolid and the 9-month regimen with ethionamide,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.950438499450684,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        387.99859619140625,
        527.5892944335938,
        402.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "given the overall similarity of the regimens, and that the 9-month regimen with linezolid would",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        401.1986083984375,
        527.4331665039062,
        415.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "probably be acceptable. The panel considered the following aspects to affect feasibility (i.e. to be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        414.39862060546875,
        527.4024047851562,
        428.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "potential barriers to implementation): requirements for drug-safety monitoring and for DST. The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        427.5986022949219,
        492.0275573730469,
        442.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "9-month regimen with linezolid would require monitoring of toxicity (e.g. anaemia) and DST.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        449.3025207519531,
        527.4014892578125,
        463.74554443359375
      ],
      "text": "The panel judged that the balance of desirable and undesirable consequences favours neither the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        462.5025939941406,
        527.515869140625,
        476.94561767578125
      ],
      "text": "9-month regimen with linezolid nor the 9-month regimen with ethionamide in this population.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        475.7025146484375,
        527.4443969726562,
        490.1455383300781
      ],
      "text": "Specifically, the panel felt that there is a fine balance between the two options in terms of benefits",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        488.9026184082031,
        527.435546875,
        503.34564208984375
      ],
      "text": "and harms that is uncertain given the overall very low certainty in the evidence (due to potential",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        502.10260009765625,
        527.3948974609375,
        516.5455932617188
      ],
      "text": "misclassification bias, confounding bias and serious indirectness). The panel judged that for most",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        515.302490234375,
        527.420166015625,
        529.7454833984375
      ],
      "text": "other evidence-to-decision criteria (e.g. resources, acceptability and feasibility) there was unlikely to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        528.5025634765625,
        527.4498291015625,
        542.945556640625
      ],
      "text": "be a large difference between the 9-month regimen with linezolid and the 9-month regimen with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        541.7025146484375,
        527.5196533203125,
        556.1455078125
      ],
      "text": "ethionamide because the only difference between the two regimens is the replacement of ethionamide",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.950789451599121,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        554.902587890625,
        527.4345703125,
        569.3455810546875
      ],
      "text": "with linezolid. Overall, the panel judged that either regimen could be used and that the flexibility",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        568.1026000976562,
        527.4091186523438,
        582.5455932617188
      ],
      "text": "of using either linezolid or ethionamide was helpful to optimize patient care. These considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        581.302490234375,
        522.7142944335938,
        595.7454833984375
      ],
      "text": "also guided the agreement of the panel on the strength of the recommendation being conditional.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        612.1464233398438,
        142.8217010498047,
        627.8064575195312
      ],
      "text": "Sub-PICO 1.2",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        635.0142822265625,
        527.2267456054688,
        649.457275390625
      ],
      "text": "The GDG acknowledged that, during the analysis, the intervention and comparator groups were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        648.2142944335938,
        527.42236328125,
        662.6572875976562
      ],
      "text": "made as comparable as possible. The panel noted that the evidence on the 9-month regimen was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        661.4144287109375,
        527.38818359375,
        675.857421875
      ],
      "text": "obtained from programmatic data from South Africa, whereas the evidence on the longer regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        674.6143798828125,
        527.3980712890625,
        689.057373046875
      ],
      "text": "represented only subsets of patients from the countries and researchers that submitted data. The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        687.8143920898438,
        527.39794921875,
        702.2573852539062
      ],
      "text": "panel also noted substantial inconsistency between cohorts in the comparator group (on the longer",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        701.0142822265625,
        527.4881591796875,
        715.457275390625
      ],
      "text": "regimens). Overall, there was concern that the selective nature of the data on the longer regimens may",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.959275245666504,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        714.2142944335938,
        527.1151123046875,
        728.6572875976562
      ],
      "text": "have biased the comparison in favour of the longer regimen. As a result, there were serious concerns",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.99544906616211,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        727.4144287109375,
        527.5797119140625,
        741.857421875
      ],
      "text": "about the comparability of the data, making it difficult to draw conclusions with confidence. The panel",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.976775169372559,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        740.6143798828125,
        527.4451904296875,
        755.057373046875
      ],
      "text": "also considered the duration and overall pill burden with the intervention and comparator regimens,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999750137329102,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        753.8143920898438,
        527.5947875976562,
        768.2573852539062
      ],
      "text": "which are both lower in the 9-month regimen and thus represent a benefit of the intervention.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.23320007324219,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "94 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.0604705810547,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        172.25680541992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        326.14483642578125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Module 4: treatment and care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}